  "description": "Tyanor — define a procedure once in C# and execute it against pluggable providers: ordered units, per-unit reconcile against live provider state, bounded retry, classified pause/fail. Resume is a re-run, not a separate code path. Includes the engine, JSON-backed run history and deployment state, optional DI wiring, and the contract suites an out-of-repo provider is proved against.",
